data: {"text":"1. That the Applicant, Rajan Kumar, son of Shri Mohan Kumar, aged 32 years, resident of Village Danapur, District Pat"}

data: {"text":"na, Bihar, has been falsely implicated in FIR No. 124/2026 dated 15.03.2026, registered at Police Station Kotwali, under Sections 303 and 351 of the"}

data: {"text":" Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita, 2023, wherein Section 303 is non-bailable and Section 351 "}

data: {"text":"is bailable.\n\n2. That the Applicant submits that he has been falsely implicated in the aforesaid FIR due to a land dispute with the complainant"}

data: {"text":". The complainant, having malicious intentions and with"}

data: {"text":" a view to harass the Applicant, has lodged a false and frivolous complaint against the Applicant"}

data: {"text":" to settle personal scores arising out of the said land dispute."}

data: {"text":"\n\n3. That the Applicant was not present at the time of the alleged incident and has credible witnesses who can prove his alibi. The Applicant was elsewhere at the material"}

data: {"text":" time and can establish his whereabouts through reliable evidence. The Applicant was"}

data: {"text":" arrested on 16.03.2026 and has been languishing in judicial custody since then without any justifiable grounds.\n\n4. That the Applicant has been falsely implicated in the present"}

data: {"text":" case and there is no credible evidence against him to establish his involvement in the alleged"}

data: {"text":" offence. The entire case is based on false allegations and the complainant has failed to produce any material evidence to substant"}

data: {"text":"iate the charges levelled against the Applicant.\n\n5. That the Applicant is a respectable member of society and has deep roots in the local community. He"}

data: {"text":" has no intention or reason to flee from justice and will abide by all conditions"}

data: {"text":" that this Hon'ble Court may deem fit to impose. The Applicant poses no flight risk what"}

data: {"text":"soever and will cooperate with the investigating agency as and when required.\n\n6. That the Applicant has no previous"}

data: {"text":" criminal antecedents and has never been involved in any criminal activity. His conduct has always been law-abiding and he has never been charged"}

data: {"text":" with or convicted of any criminal offence in the past. The present case is the first instance where he has been falsely r"}

data: {"text":"oped in due to personal enmity.\n\n7. That the Applicant has been fully cooperating with the investigation and will continue"}

data: {"text":" to do so. He has not tampered with any evidence nor has he influenced any witness. The Applicant is ready to comply with all reasonable conditions that"}

data: {"text":" this Hon'ble Court may impose while granting bail.\n\n8. That the continued detention of the Applicant in judicial custody is a"}

data: {"text":" violation of his fundamental right to life and personal liberty as guaranteed under Article 21 of the Constitution of India. The prolonged inc"}

data: {"text":"arceration without sufficient grounds amounts to deprivation of liberty without due process of law.\n\n9. That the investigation in the"}

data: {"text":" present case is pending and there is no likelihood of the same being completed in the immediate future. The continued"}

data: {"text":" custody of the Applicant will not serve any useful purpose and will only cause undue hardship to him and his family members"}

data: {"text":" who are dependent upon him.\n\n10. That the Applicant undertakes to comply with all conditions that may be imposed by this Hon'ble Court while granting bail,"}

data: {"text":" including regular appearance before the investigating officer, surrender of passport if any"}

data: {"text":", and not to leave the jurisdiction of this Hon'ble Court without prior permission."}

